{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Sakigake!! Otokojuku (Movie)","Otokojuku, a private school for juvenile delinquents that were previously expelled from normal schools. At this school, Japanese chivalry is taught through the feudal and military fundamentals. Similar to an action film, the classes are overwhelmed by violence. Only those who survive it become true men.\n\n(Source: Animenfo)"],"ja":["魁!!男塾 (Movie)",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":2903,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-4031","ids":{"shikimori":4031,"mal":4031,"anilist":4031,"kodik":"movie-113943"},"kodikIds":["movie-54523","movie-113943"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-54523":"2020-04-29T13:25:38Z","movie-113943":"2025-10-20T12:02:09Z"},"title":"Вперёд, школьник! Фильм","originalTitle":"Sakigake!! Otokojuku Movie","alt":"Sakigake!! Otoko Juku (1988) 魁!!男塾 (Movie)","description":"Отокодзюку - частная школа для несовершеннолетних правонарушителей, которые ранее были исключены из обычных школ. В этой школе японское рыцарство преподается на основе феодальных и военных основ. Как в боевике, классы переполнены насилием. Только те, кто переживает это, становятся настоящими мужчинами.","year":1988,"type":"MOVIE","genres":["Сёнен","Экшен","Комедия","хулиганы","боевые искусства","Школа"],"rating":6.77,"popularity":993,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[2903],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/4031/18e5834d92b5db93bfe1d482aaa7d06d.jpeg","width":340,"height":484},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/a2ba0fa16cef7e16d8621ef9cfd366de793aac44.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1051","dubId":"1051","label":"Kallaider","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-54523","translationId":"1051","url":"https://kod